cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying data, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "B-CAREs: Breast Cancer Assessment, Reporting and Risk Stratification system"
abstract: >-
  Code for a multi-task ultrasound framework that predicts BI-RADS category,
  histological subtype and sentinel lymph node metastasis and assembles a
  structured clinical report.
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-26"
license: MIT
